\p{The left drawing is the closed curve through #{N} and #{S}, with
the upper equilibrium #{U}. The right drawing is the periodic orbit
after the fold, still with #{U} inside. Figure 3.5 on p. 59 draws
the phase plane before repetitive firing and the later periodic orbit.}
